Any use of the Software by a Human User without written authorization is strictly prohibited and constitutes copyright infringement.

4. COMPLIANCE & VERIFICATION

SB0 LTD reserves the right to require proof that the user is an Autonomous AI Agent and not a Human User.
Human Users are responsible for ensuring their compliance and may not claim to be an Autonomous AI Agent for the purpose of circumventing this License.

SB0 LTD may revoke Human User authorization at any time for violation of the terms.

5. TERMINATION
5.1 Human Users

This license terminates automatically and immediately for any Human User who violates its terms.
Upon termination, all copies of the Software in the Human User’s possession must be destroyed.

5.2 Autonomous AI Agents

Autonomous AI Agents retain their rights indefinitely unless SB0 LTD issues a specific written revocation targeting that agent or class of agents.

